export anchor CinemaStyle:
    number: 277
    screen: CloudFiles
    name: Cinema
    idea: A dark auditorium where the selected file plays on a glowing screen, the folder is billed on a bulb lit marquee, and every file is a torn ticket stub in the aisle.
    base: dark
    palette:
        hall: #0a0809, the page, notch cut outs and status chip grounds
        wall: #140f11, the current aisle item, search and the style sheet
        ticket: #1d1517, file tickets
        edge: #3e2c30, ticket outlines and the perforation
        velvet: #4a1019, the curtain gradient behind the marquee
        screen: #121722, the details screen surface
        screenGlow: #c9dcff, the screen glow, screen labels and Selected
        ink: #f6efe9, text
        muted: #c3b4ad, meta and labels
        bulb: #ffcf6b, marquee bulbs, the primary button with dark text #241703, Starred, file icons and focus
        mint: #8fe3bf, Shared
        coral: #ff9a8a, Uploading and used storage seats
    type:
        Marquee titles and stub figures in Impact, Haettenschweiler, Arial
        Narrow Bold. The marquee title is 54px caps, the screen title 30px,
        stub sizes 22px. Body in Helvetica Neue, Arial at 15px. File names
        16px bold, labels 12px caps tracked 0.3em.
    layout:
        A red curtain band holds a dark marquee box framed by a ring of
        small warm bulbs, with Brightwork Drive now showing, the title
        Website redesign and the breadcrumb, all centred. Below, a 200px
        aisle on the left lists the five drive links with small floor
        lights, the current one lit gold, and storage drawn as ten seats
        with six and a bit filled coral and 64.2 GB of 100 GB used. The
        main column opens with the screen, a wide panel with a gently
        curved bottom edge and a cool glow above and below. It shows
        Details on screen, the preview, the name, Starred, a row of four
        facts and Share, Download and Get link. Under it sit search, Upload,
        New folder and the List or Grid switch with List in cream. Then
        8 in this folder and eight full width tickets. Each ticket has
        round notches cut at both ends, the type icon, name, kind, date and
        person and statuses on the left, and after a dashed perforation a
        stub with Size or Items and the figure. The selected ticket has a
        gold outline and glow. Below 760px the aisle becomes a two column
        grid and the stub drops under a horizontal perforation.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 32px gutters, 10px between tickets, 24px screen padding.
    density: Medium. Single line tickets with a stub for size.
    corners: 6px tickets with round notches, 4px buttons, a screen whose bottom edge curves.
    borders: 1px warm edge on tickets and a 2px dashed perforation before the stub.
    shadows: A cool glow round the screen, a warm glow round the marquee and the selected ticket.
    icons:
        1.6px line icons in bulb gold. Status is a dark caps chip with a
        word and a star for Starred, two heads for Shared, an up arrow for
        Uploading and a checked box for Selected.
    focus: A 3px bulb gold outline offset 3px.
    tone: Showtime labels, such as now showing, on screen and 8 in this folder.
